{
  "An input for a date, a time or both. Users can type through a mask in the locale's order, or pick from a calendar and a list of times. `min`, `max` and `disabledDates` apply to both methods.": "",
  "Locales": "Yerel ayarlar",
  "The mask follows the locale, including the order of day, month and year and the separators. Month and day names in the calendar and the first day of the week also come from the locale.": "",
  "Time and date with time": "Saat ve saatli tarih",
  "Limits and validation": "Sınırlar ve validation",
  "Fills in the mask and skips separators. The value changes once the date is complete and valid.": "",
  "Opens the calendar or the list of times, with focus on the selected day.": "",
  "Arrow keys, Home, End, Page Up and Page Down (with Shift, a year), and Enter to select. See Calendar.": "",
  "Up, Down, Home, End, Page Up, Page Down and Enter.": "",
  "Closes the picker. With `clearButton` and the picker closed, clears the value.": "",
  "A native `<input>` with its label. The format is the mask the user types into.": "",
  "`aria-haspopup=\"dialog\"` and `aria-expanded`, named from `uiLocale` (\"Choose date\" or \"Choose time\").": "",
  "A `role=\"dialog\"` containing the calendar grid (see Calendar) and a list of times (`role=\"listbox\"`).": "",
  "A date that does not exist, falls outside `min` and `max`, or is disabled fails validation with a message from `uiLocale`.": "",
  "Button names and messages come from `uiLocale.strings`. Dates and names come from `locale`.": "",
  "Added to the field; `data-type=\"date|time|datetime\"`.": "Field'a eklenir; `data-type=\"date|time|datetime\"`.",
  "The picker and clear buttons.": "Seçici ve temizleme düğmeleri.",
  "The picker and its list of times.": "Seçici ve saat listesi.",
  "The list of times (a unit: `focus`, `beside`), the space between the field and its popup, and the calendar as it appears in the popup (a place). Everything else comes from `field.*` and `calendar.*`.": "",
  "The date. `x-model` provides two-way binding.": "",
  "A date, a time of day, or both.": "",
  "Sets the order of the parts (`25.10.2026`, `10/25/2026`), the month and day names, and the first day of the week.": "",
  "Limits for typing and picking, enforced by validation.": "",
  "Days that cannot be selected, such as weekends.": "",
  "How the value is displayed while the field is not being edited: `{ dateStyle: 'long' }`.": "",
  "Displayed when the field is empty and has no focus.": "",
  "Clears the value. Escape does the same.": "",
  "The button that opens the calendar or the list of times.": "",
  "The interval between the times offered, in minutes.": "",
  "Includes seconds in the time.": "",
  "See Calendar": "",
  "Passed to the calendar.": "Takvime aktarılır.",
  "Indicates that the typed text is not yet a complete, valid date.": "",
  "The picker.": "Seçici.",
  "These work the same way as in DropDown and TextBox.": "",
  "The date helpers are shared: `datePatternOf(locale, kind)`, `dateToDigits`, `digitsToDate`.": "Tarih yardımcıları ortaktır: `datePatternOf(locale, kind)`, `dateToDigits`, `digitsToDate`."
